# Security

Checklist: `.cursor/checklists/security.md` and `.cursor/checklists/auth-tenant.md`.

## Non-negotiable

- Every tenant route: `@UseGuards(SupabaseAuthGuard, CompanyMembershipGuard)` + `@RequireCompanyMembership`. Missing metadata → 500 (fail-closed).
- Actor ids (`created_by`, `approved_by`, `closed_by`, …) come from `@CurrentUser()`, never the body (`feature-spec.md` #10).
- Global `ValidationPipe`: `whitelist` + `forbidNonWhitelisted`. Purpose-built update DTOs — do not `PartialType(CreateDto)` if that would expose `company_id`, status, or identity fields.
- Roles: enum has six values; **only Owner and Manager** are enforced for journal approve/reject. Do not invent a full RBAC module (1.6). Resolve role from `company_members` every time.
- Non-member → **403**, not 404 (`CompanyMembersService.resolveRole`).
- IDOR: load the resource, resolve `company_id`, then membership — never “id exists globally therefore allow.”
- Errors: map known tokens via `database-error.mapper.ts`; do not leak stack traces or other tenants’ rows.

## Verification when touching this surface

Run `controller-auth-coverage.spec.ts` (route list), `node scripts/verify-auth-module-imports.mjs` (AuthModule wiring), and the relevant membership/RLS integration spec. Update `CompanyResourceKind` when adding `:id` resources.

## Do not

- Disable RLS; skip guards “just for this route”; take role from the client; log tokens or secret keys.